---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Help & Support | Spark" description="Get help with Spark: sign-in, family sharing, subscriptions, reminders, and deleting your account.">
  <div class="doc">
      <h1>Help &amp; support</h1>
      <p class="updated">We're a small team and we read every message.</p>

      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0; font-size: 22px">Email us</h2>
        <p>
          Tell us what's going on and, if you can, which iPhone and iOS version you're using. We usually reply within
          two business days.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn-ink" href="mailto:support@sparkhabitstracker.com?subject=Spark%20support">support@sparkhabitstracker.com</a>
      </div>

      <h2>Common questions</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <details>
          <summary>I didn't get my sign-in email</summary>
          <p>
            Check your spam or promotions folder, and make sure the address is spelled correctly. The email includes a
            6-digit code you can type into the App if the link opens on a different device.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How do I add another grown-up to my family?</summary>
          <p>
            Family sharing is part of Spark Plus. Go to Family → Invite and share the code or link. On their phone,
            they install Spark and tap "I have an invite code" on the welcome screen. Codes expire after 7 days.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>My partner subscribed. Why don't I see Plus?</summary>
          <p>
            Plus is shared with everyone in the subscriber's family. Make sure you joined the same family with an invite
            code. Then close and reopen the App. If it still doesn't show, email us.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How do I restore my purchase on a new phone?</summary>
          <p>Sign in with the same account, go to Family, and tap Restore purchases.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How do I cancel Spark Plus?</summary>
          <p>
            Open the Settings app on your iPhone, tap your name, then Subscriptions, then Spark. Cancel at least 24
            hours before your renewal date to avoid being charged. Deleting the App doesn't cancel a subscription.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How do I get a refund?</summary>
          <p>
            Apple handles all payments and refunds. Request one at
            <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>I'm not getting reminders</summary>
          <p>
            Check that notifications for Spark are on in your iPhone's Settings → Notifications → Spark, and that the
            habit has reminders turned on. Reminders are set on each phone, so every grown-up turns them on separately.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How is a streak counted?</summary>
          <p>
            A streak is the number of days in a row where every scheduled habit was done. Days with nothing scheduled
            are skipped, and an unfinished today doesn't break your streak.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How do I delete my account and data?</summary>
          <p>
            In the App, go to Family → Delete account. If you're the only grown-up in your family, all of your family's
            data is deleted. If others are in your family, the shared data stays with them. You can also email us to ask
            for deletion. Remember to cancel any subscription in your App Store settings too.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 32px">
        See also our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a>.
      </p>
  </div>
</Base>
